  "body": "Fix calculation of final-layer\r\nAccording to ISO/IEC 11172-3 2.4.2.3 the valid values for layer are:\r\nlayer I: '11': 3\r\nlayer II: '10' : 2\r\nlayer III: '01' : 1\r\nSo 4-value is we want to get after mask operand and bit shifting.",
